Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright 2026 Karan Garg

Karan Garg claims copyright only in the modifications and additions he has made
to the original work, not in the original work itself. Those modifications are
licensed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.

The principal modifications made to the upstream template are:

  * Replacement of the single-vendor model layer with a provider-agnostic
    registry supporting Anthropic, OpenAI, Groq, OpenRouter, any
    OpenAI-compatible endpoint (Ollama, llama.cpp, vLLM, LM Studio) and the
    original Vercel AI Gateway, selected entirely by environment configuration.
  * Runtime model discovery from the configured provider, replacing the
    hardcoded model catalog.
  * A self-hosting path: Dockerfile and Docker Compose stack with PostgreSQL.
  * A local-filesystem file storage driver, so Vercel Blob is optional.
  * Vercel platform services (Blob storage, bot detection, OpenTelemetry
    export) made optional and disabled by default.
  * Removal of third-party runtime requests from the browser.
  * Project documentation, continuous integration, and security policy.

